1. 📌 Project Overview

This project demonstrates the implementation of Infrastructure as Code (IaC) using Terraform to automate the provisioning of Azure Resource Groups and Azure Storage Accounts.

The solution uses Terraform for_each functionality to dynamically create multiple Azure resources using reusable configurations.

The project follows real-world DevOps practices for scalable, consistent, and automated infrastructure deployment in Microsoft Azure cloud environments.
2. 🎯 Objective

The primary objectives of this project are:

Automate Azure infrastructure deployment
Reduce manual provisioning efforts
Implement reusable Terraform code
Enable scalable infrastructure creation
Follow DevOps and Infrastructure as Code best practices

